OL,3,GNEWSA'Most of us will be gone' - behind
OL,4,Aa market controversy
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe market square in Cambridge has had
OL,7,Ftraders since the Middle Ages. But why
OL,8,Fhave multi-million pound plans to
OL,9,Fredevelop it caused such controversy
OL,10,Fwith traders?
OL,12,FThe revamped market is slated to be
OL,13,Fpart of a wider redevelopment of the
OL,14,Fcity centre, which will cost more than
OL,15,F#90m.
OL,17,FThose behind the market proposals hope
OL,18,Fit will have a mix of permanent and
OL,19,Fremovable stalls. Those would offer
OL,20,F"flexibility" for daily trading while
OL,21,Fallowing space for events and cultural
OL,22,Factivities.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
